UI 提供一個",[335,336,337],"strong",{},"使用 skill","，教 AI agent 用 Shuo UI 撰寫表單與查詢頁面。",[323,340,341],{"id":341},"使用方式",[328,343,344],{},"使用 skill 讓 AI agent 完整了解如何以 Shuo UI 開發，涵蓋：",[346,347,348,352,355,371,374,377,383],"ul",{},[349,350,351],"li",{},"安裝與 CSS 設定",[349,353,354],{},"17 個元件的 v-model 型別、主要 props、slots 與常見陷阱",[349,356,357,358,362,363,366,367,370],{},"搭配 ",[359,360,361],"code",{},"UForm","、",[359,364,365],{},"UFormField"," 與 Valibot 的表單驗證，以及共用規則（",[359,368,369],{},"requiredText"," 等）",[349,372,373],{},"各元件的空值約定與初始 state 寫法",[349,375,376],{},"查詢條件卡片搭配結果清單的伺服器端分頁寫法",[349,378,379,382],{},[359,380,381],{},"shuoUi"," 模組選項：全站預設值、語系與文案、主題",[349,384,385],{},"日期、數字、電話、月數的顯示工具函式",[328,387,388,389,394],{},"skill 附有額外的 references，agent 依任務需要才讀取，回答更聚焦也更省 context。需要完整 props 表或更多範例時，skill 會引導 agent 讀取文件網站上對應頁面的 ",[390,391,393],"a",{"href":392},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fagents\u002Fllms-txt#%E5%96%AE%E4%B8%80%E9%A0%81%E9%9D%A2%E7%9A%84-markdown-%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC","markdown 版本","。",[396,397,398,399,402],"note",{},"安裝後，在 agent 的對話框輸入 ",[359,400,401],{},"\u002Fshuo-ui"," 即可呼叫這個 skill。",[404,405,407],"h3",{"id":406},"skills-cli","Skills CLI",[328,409,410,418],{},[390,411,415],{"href":412,"rel":413},"https:\u002F\u002Fskills.sh",[414],"nofollow",[359,416,417],{},"skills"," CLI 是安裝 Shuo UI skill 最簡單的方式，支援 Cursor、Claude Code、Codex、Windsurf、Cline 等多種 agent。",[420,421,426],"pre",{"className":422,"code":423,"language":424,"meta":425,"style":425},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","npx skills add k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui\n","bash","",[359,427,428],{"__ignoreMap":425},[429,430,433,437,441,444],"span",{"class":431,"line":432},"line",1,[429,434,436],{"class":435},"sBMFI","npx",[429,438,440],{"class":439},"sfazB"," skills",[429,442,443],{"class":439}," add",[429,445,446],{"class":439}," k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui\n",[328,448,449,450,453],{},"用 ",[359,451,452],{},"--agent"," 指定 agent：",[420,455,457],{"className":422,"code":456,"languag